    "text": "19 hours ago A Hopkins County man is facing a murder charge after allegedly beating a woman to death in a domestic violence incident. The assault took place on Saturday night at approximately 6:25 when Hopkins County deputies responded to a residence on Antioch Church Road in Hanson after the victim’s mother heard screams coming from the home, according to a report by WFIE.com. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 11",
